// PRV Beauty — build configuration template.
//
// Copy to Config/Secrets.xcconfig and fill in your project's values, then run
// `xcodegen generate`. Secrets.xcconfig is .gitignore'd; this template is not.
//
// Leaving these blank is supported and intentional: the app then composes the
// seeded demo backend, so it always builds and runs without a Supabase project.
//
// The anon key is safe to ship in an app binary — it grants nothing by itself,
// because row-level security is the real boundary (docs/SECURITY.md §3). The
// service-role key must NEVER appear here; it belongs only in Edge Function
// secrets.

PRV_SUPABASE_URL =
PRV_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY =
